# Production parts for the multi-object 3MF plate deliverable,
# build/calibration-cube-plate.3mf (scripts/plate.sh, gate.sh --check).
#
# Four dimensional-accuracy cubes (5 / 10 / 20 / 30 mm) print SEPARATELY on
# one plate. A single STL of all four imports as one multi-body (or fused)
# lump; the plate packs them as N distinct objects the slicer imports as N
# parts. The parametric default `cube` and the `sweep` layout preview are
# NOT plate parts.
cube5
cube10
cube20
cube30
